config DVB_MESON_DEMUX
	tristate "Amlogic transport stream demux"
	depends on DVB_CORE
	depends on ARCH_MESON || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Support for the transport stream demultiplexer of the Amlogic
	  GXBB, GXL, GXM, G12A, G12B and SM1 SoCs.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called meson-demux.
